<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Credits | MCSeverStatus</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/rastikerdar/vazirmatn@v33.003/Vazirmatn-font-face.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Vazirmatn', 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1e2e 0%, #2d1b3d 50%, #1e1e2e 100%);
            background-size: 400% 400%;
            animation: gradientShift 15s ease infinite;
            color: #fff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        @keyframes gradientShift {
            0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
            100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 4em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            animation: bounce 2s ease infinite;
        }
        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-15px); }
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            font-weight: bold;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #a855f7, #ec4899, #a855f7);
            background-size: 200% auto;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            animation: shine 3s linear infinite;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        @keyframes shine {
            to { background-position: 200% center; }
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #888;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
        }

        .credit-card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(168,85,247,0.3);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .credit-card:hover {
            border-color: #a855f7;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(168,85,247,0.3);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .avatar {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 3px solid #a855f7;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(168,85,247,0.5);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .name {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #a855f7;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .role {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .link-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }
        .link-btn.github {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            color: #fff;
            border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
        }
        .link-btn.github:hover {
            background: #333;
            border-color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }
        .link-btn.telegram {
            background: rgba(38,165,228,0.15);
            color: #26a5e4;
            border-color: rgba(38,165,228,0.4);
        }
        .link-btn.telegram:hover {
            background: #26a5e4;
            color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .stack {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .tech {
            background: rgba(168,85,247,0.2);
            color: #a855f7;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
        .footer .heart {
            color: #ec4899;
            animation: heartbeat 1.5s ease infinite;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        @keyframes heartbeat {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="icon">🎮</div>
        <h1>Credits</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">MCSeverStatus</p>

        <div class="credit-card">
            <img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/310891506" alt="TheAghaBanafshi" class="avatar" />
            <div class="name">آقا بنفشی</div>
            <div class="role">توسعه‌دهنده و سازنده پروژه</div>

            <div class="links">
                <a href="https://github.com/TheAghaBanafshi" class="link-btn github">
